Note for future contributors
----------------------------

Because this project is dual-licensed, the copyright holders must be able to
license every line of it under both sets of terms. Contributions from outside
the group of copyright holders therefore require a contributor licence
agreement before they can be merged. Please open an issue before submitting a
substantial patch.
